<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, flexDirection: 'row', background: '#FFFFFF', overflow: 'hidden' }}>

    {/* 左：深蓝标题栏 */}
    <Box style={{ width: 396, height: 720, background: '#0E3F8C', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', paddingTop: 60, paddingBottom: 60, paddingLeft: 56, paddingRight: 44, overflow: 'hidden' }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7FA0D2', letterSpacing: 5 }}>CONTENTS</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 54, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginTop: 14, letterSpacing: 4 }}>目　录</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 64, height: 3, background: '#3D7BD9', marginTop: 22 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#9FBCE8', lineHeight: 1.85, marginTop: 22 }}>
                三个板块逐层递进：<br />从真实问题出发，<br />经设计落到可运行的实现。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 13, marginTop: 26 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#6E8FC4', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 2 }}>篇幅分配</Text>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#7FA0D2', width: 20 }}>01</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 5, background: '#1B4A94', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: '38%', height: 5, background: '#3D7BD9', borderRadius: 3 }} />
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#9FBCE8', width: 30 }}>2 页</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#7FA0D2', width: 20 }}>02</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 5, background: '#1B4A94', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: '58%', height: 5, background: '#3D7BD9', borderRadius: 3 }} />
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#9FBCE8', width: 30 }}>3 页</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#7FA0D2', width: 20 }}>03</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 5, background: '#1B4A94', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: '78%', height: 5, background: '#3D7BD9', borderRadius: 3 }} />
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#9FBCE8', width: 30 }}>4 页</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#2E5FA8', marginTop: 10, marginBottom: 8 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6E8FC4' }}>2026 年 10 月 · 毕业设计答辩</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* 右：章节条目 */}
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 720, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingTop: 46, paddingBottom: 56, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64 }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 18 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 18, height: 2, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', letterSpacing: 2 }}>答辩提纲 · 共 14 页</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 26, paddingTop: 24, paddingBottom: 24, borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 50, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C3D6EF', width: 76 }}>01</Text>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>背景与需求分析</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                    排期靠人工登记、报修走纸质单，冲突只能事后扯皮。<br />从 12 间实验室的真实失效点，提炼四类角色与功能边界。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 5, width: 84 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>P04 — P05</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>2 页</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 26, paddingTop: 24, paddingBottom: 24, borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 50, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C3D6EF', width: 76 }}>02</Text>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>系统设计</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                    三层架构与选型理由、7 张表的数据模型，<br />以及把「时间冲突」压成一个不等式、把流程压成两条状态机。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 5, width: 84 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>P07 — P09</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>3 页</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 26, paddingTop: 24, paddingBottom: 24 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 50, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C3D6EF', width: 76 }}>03</Text>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>实现与测试</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                    预约、排期、运维三条主线的真实运行界面，<br />以及 33 项接口断言与 13 个页面的验证结果。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 5, width: 84 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>P11 — P14</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>4 页</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, background: '#F0F5FC', paddingTop: 16, paddingBottom: 16, paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 2 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 3, height: 42, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                一句话概括：<span style={{ color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>约束写进代码，流程才可追溯</span>——这是全部设计取舍的出发点。
            </Text>
        </Box>

    </Box>
</Slide>
